{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f1181b9d637b5e11f4ba417bfb7afdc8c8375ae93c6f337c342cfcfb66c404fb","ja":"勝利の理由","zh":"胜利的理由","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8507d00ea77713e3fdfcae84a41b44d1814cb7d5b83acc9849746bfaefb04107","ja":"……ウソっ！　あの点差から、ひっくり返しちゃう\nなんて……すごい、すごいよ！　まつり♪","zh":"……骗人的吧！居然能从那样的分差反超……太厉害了，太厉害了！茉莉♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5efeca08bb6647914ca6606d62b7a467ab74e3635799b75602b23dde0a99c1a8","ja":"恵美ちゃんががんばったおかげなのです！\n姫はただ、ボールをレシーブしただけなのですよ♪","zh":"都是因为惠美努力了呀！\n公主只是接到了球而已哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"9ccf2ce230bb04d523bcc2986e25022870509d672627c3fda86863f3e8109c49","ja":"も～、絶対勝てると思ってたのにな～！","zh":"真是的～明明觉得肯定能赢的～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"aa02a52267327b653f54998f52fef74931a96353e9e37417277566d8d567f3bc","ja":"的確な位置へのれしーぶ……\nこーとを駆け回る俊敏な動き……。","zh":"准确位置的接球……\n在球场上飞奔的敏捷动作……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4f3946f611913c1507bf40247e067054a6fd580e4d02ebaa3e0a5f51e1f0df56","ja":"最後には、強烈なあたっくを決められてしまいました。\nまさか、まつり姫の実力があそこまでのものとは……。","zh":"最后还是被狠狠地攻击了。\n没想到，茉莉公主的实力竟然强到了那种地步……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"98ace50df427a095967b112097427215d2cf0bb488573963ff5c479c1da50532","ja":"でも、途中まで圧勝してたんですよ！\nやっぱり悔しいです！","zh":"但是，我们之前明明一直大幅领先的！\n果然还是很不甘心！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8951733593c52bf61a91367173cd3cf16056b772edc6768b456df43640618225","ja":"恵美さん、まつりさん！\nリベンジさせてくださ～い！","zh":"惠美、茉莉！\n请让我一雪前耻吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"568f4cf2ec028dd7a71dd2d429d4230009da7a5917e5b3ce13e165ea54f051e3","ja":"オッケーだよ！　……それにしても、まつりがこんなに\nビーチバレー強かったなんて知らなかったよ♪","zh":"没问题！……不过话说回来，我还真不知道まつり的沙滩排球打得这么好♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"13e6fcea6a23869155a49b892164e876b42c1f6c19652a75005353ab15c67c09","ja":"最後のアタックなんて、目にも止まらぬ速さって\n感じだったし……次の試合もよろしくね、にゃはは！","zh":"最后那一击，感觉快得连眼睛都跟不上了……下场比赛也请多关照啦，呀哈哈！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"4b7ed69bddf628cb49b91774c90ad922f785428264eedb3c70bc72d634dcec3e","ja":"ほ？　姫はスポーツが苦手なのですよ？　さっきのは\n妖精さんがサポートしてくれたおかげなのです♪","zh":"咦？公主不擅长运动哦？刚才那是多亏了妖精们帮忙♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c7a53d128a6114e1bca27af37a01b5092e233a4dd035b5eb34b0e191a9e1902e","ja":"……えっ！？","zh":"……诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"8fa02f096707998aa54ac12ba36e6b338793404801dcfdbf63aa852fa7438ae1","ja":"それにまつり、さっきの試合でへとへとなのです……。\nだから、あとは恵美ちゃんに任せたのです！","zh":"而且小祭在刚才的比赛中已经累得筋疲力尽了……  \n所以，接下来就交给惠美啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_905.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"90d989a60813fef43c56944ba2e432ab57d692bda0deb612204dbdf35f7f8b6e","ja":"ええ～っ！？　待ってよまつり、さっきまであんなに\n元気そうに動いてたじゃん！　ちょっと～！","zh":"诶～！？等等啊，茉莉，你刚才不是还活蹦乱跳的吗！真是的～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
